  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hKaK8BE.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>透過更流暢的過場、可自訂的選單以及動畫化的介面元件，提升您的遊戲體驗。享受沉浸且直覺的介面，讓您的《我的世界》世界比以往更加生動。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UHOcBu4.gif\" alt=\"\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>目前，IUI 提供以下功能：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>持有非普通稀有度物品時（游標上的物品），會留下粒子尾跡</li>\n<li>於背包內快速移動持有物品時，該物品會產生晃動效果</li>\n<li>游標下方的物品會自動縮放</li>\n<li>快捷欄選擇器動畫流暢自然</li>\n<li>容器內與游標物品相同的物品會產生浮動效果</li>\n<li>還有更多！</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fTMTKyIY.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://i.imgur.com/TMTKyIY.png</a>)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1.21.x：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n<li><strong>1.20.1：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>NeoForge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Quilt</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">歡迎自由將本模組納入您的整合包中 ;)</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KSJusYp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div>\n<p>未定義</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/immersive-ui\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-ui\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fimmersive-ui%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fimmersive-ui%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dImmersive%2bUI%2b(from%2bwww.curseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">**想嘗試我們的其他模組嗎？請造訪 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 以獲取更多資訊！**</p>",
